{"id":"730edd22d82070e5","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-subdirect-representation.md","title":"thm-subdirect-representation","display":"thm-subdirect-representation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]"],"display":"thm-subdirect-representation","label":"93-thm-subdirect-representation","aliases":["93-thm-subdirect-representation"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subdirect-representation"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-subdirect-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-subdirect-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-subdirect-representation-thm-subdirect-representation\">thm-subdirect-representation <code>thm-subdirect-representation</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is nontrivial.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span> are the quotient-family and explicit congruence-class constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li>The congruence family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\theta\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\theta\\)</span> and the canonical embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> are explicit function graphs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\theta\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:I\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(\\boldsymbol\\theta)=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i);\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\delta=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\n(\\delta,\\mathbf A,\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta;I,\\tau);I,\\tau)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\theta\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:I\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(\\boldsymbol\\theta)=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i);\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\delta=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\n(\\delta,\\mathbf A,\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta;I,\\tau);I,\\tau)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is Birkhoff's theorem under the nontrivial-SI convention fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>. The embedding and every surjective coordinate map are bundled by the sourced predicate.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-subdirect-representation-thm-subdirect-representation","text":"thm-subdirect-representation `thm-subdirect-representation`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]] and [[93-df-subdirect-product]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}$, and $\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}$ are the quotient-family and explicit congruence-class constructors of [[93-df-quotient-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This is Birkhoff's theorem under the nontrivial-SI convention fixed in [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]. The embedding and every surjective coordinate map are bundled by the sourced predicate.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subdirect\\text{-}representation}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\theta\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land\\boldsymbol\\theta:I\\to\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(\\boldsymbol\\theta)=\\Delta_{\\mathbf A}\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i);\\tau))\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\land\\delta=\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta(i))\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\n\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\n(\\delta,\\mathbf A,\\operatorname{QuotFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\boldsymbol\\theta;I,\\tau);I,\\tau)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1944,"backlinks":[{"id":"3296916b733e08cd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3bbb7b7bf7df9f89","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","510bd94349c4c6d9","aa0a957ca4da4328","130ab752f509ade2"]}